cff-version: 1.2.0
title: "Protocol Sensitivity in Remaining-Useful-Life Model Comparisons: Retrospective C-MAPSS Analysis and a Pre-Outcome-Frozen Battery Study"
message: "If you use this code or reproducibility artifact, please cite the software release and complete evidence archive."
type: software
authors:
  - family-names: "Liu"
    given-names: "Zhihao"
version: "5.5.0"
date-released: "2026-09-26"
license: MIT
repository-code: "https://github.com/Ethan0infinity/rul-benchmark-protocol-audit"
url: "https://osf.io/u76ze/"
abstract: "Code accompanying a retrospective four-task C-MAPSS comparison and a battery study with a protocol fixed before training and test-label evaluation. The C-MAPSS analysis uses a pre-aggregation lock, not preregistration. Results do not establish a universal model winner or field maintenance benefit."
keywords:
  - remaining useful life
  - C-MAPSS
  - battery aging
  - benchmark audit
  - reproducibility
  - protocol sensitivity
